  designNotes: 'Trick, turned to stats (the user, 2026-10-17): target creature and
    the creature facing it trade Attack and Health, each waking up in the other''s
    body. Aim it at their glass cannon facing your wall, or the other way round.'
  artDescription: 'A mother and her teenage daughter facing each other across a breakfast
    table, a broken fortune cookie between them, their faces swapped: the mother
    with a nose ring and headphones, the daughter in reading glasses holding a mug
    reading WORLD''S BEST MOM, both screaming.'
